title: "Does adjusting for tumor proliferation bias prognostic gene expression estimates? Preregistered analysis code, decision rules and results"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nam"
    given-names: "Soon Woo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5562-4775"
    affiliation: "Hepatobiliary Unit, Division of Gastroenterology, Department of Internal Medicine, Incheon St. Mary's Hospital, College of Medicine, The Catholic University of Korea, Seoul, Republic of Korea"
version: "2.3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: MIT
keywords:
